OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a fresh start, it'll be
OL,6,Fmostly dry with sunny spells. Showers
OL,7,Faffecting the far north, these
OL,8,Fgradually easing into the afternoon
OL,9,Facross Scotland. Rather cool in the
OL,10,Fnorth, warm in the sunshine in the
OL,11,Fsouth.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny showers across Scotland
OL,14,Feasing tonight, leaving many with a
OL,15,Fdry night and clear spells. Feeling
OL,16,Fcool in the countryside with
OL,17,Ftemperatures down in the low single
OL,18,Ffigures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
