OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA few showers in Scotland,
OL,6,Fotherwise fine and dry with plenty of
OL,7,Fhazy sunshine in the south. Very warm
OL,8,Fhere, with cloud thickening in the
OL,9,Fwest later.
